{"name":"Toscana","hex":"#9f846b","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Toscana (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Toscana is a 2022 Danish romantic comedy drama film, written and directed by Mehdi Avaz and starring Anders Matthesen as the fictional Michelin cook Theo Dahl. The film was released on 18 May 2022 exclusively on Netflix as the first Danish Netflix Original feature film. It was largely received negatively by critics—who especially criticised its predictability and script—but it was a success among viewers, becoming the fifth-most watched film worldwide on Netflix during its first week."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/35/Toscana_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toscana_(film)","wikidata":"Q112133367"},{"title":"Tuscany","blocks":[{"text":"Tuscany is a region of central Italy. With a population of 3,659,222 in an area of 22,987.04 square kilometres, it is the 9th most populous and 5th-largest region of Italy. The capital and largest city is Florence."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Tuscany_in_Italy.svg/330px-Tuscany_in_Italy.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tuscany","wikidata":"Q1273"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Chimera_d%27arezzo%2C_fi%2C_03.JPG/500px-Chimera_d%27arezzo%2C_fi%2C_03.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Chimera_d%27arezzo%2C_fi%2C_03.JPG/1280px-Chimera_d%27arezzo%2C_fi%2C_03.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Chimera_d%27arezzo%2C_fi%2C_03.JPG/500px-Chimera_d%27arezzo%2C_fi%2C_03.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parse